like we've got a nice surplus going but nowhere to put it. More batteries would let us bank that extra power for later.","We're generating well above what the grid needs right now. Adding some battery capacity would help us hold onto that excess.","There's quite a bit of power going unused. If we had more batteries, we could save it up for when we really need it."},new string[]{"It looks like the batteries are draining faster than we can recharge them. We might want to consider adding more backup power to keep up.","The batteries aren't lasting very long at this rate. Some additional backup generation could really help extend our runway.","We're burning through battery reserves pretty quickly. More backup power would give us a bigger safety net.","I'm watching the batteries drop faster than I'd like. Adding more generation capacity would help us keep up with demand."},new string[]{"Our backup power is running but the batteries are charging pretty slowly. We might need stronger or more backup sources to recharge faster.","The backup kicked in but it's barely keeping up. It's taking a long time to recharge - more backup capacity would speed things up.","I'm seeing the backup running for a while now and batteries are still climbing slowly. We could use some more generation muscle here.","Backup power is on but it's a slow charge. Adding more reactors or H2 engines would help us recharge and get back to normal quicker."},new string[]{"I've noticed the backup power is cycling on and off quite a bit. We might need more renewables to carry the base load, or our battery bank could be oversized for our generation capacity.","The backup keeps kicking in pretty frequently. More renewable generation could help reduce how often we need to fall back on fuel.","Our backup sources are working hard with all this cycling. Either more renewables would help cover demand, or we might have more battery storage than our generation can keep up with.","Backup power has been activating a lot. Adding more renewable capacity would help stretch the time between backup cycles."},new string[]{"Our renewables are working but they're not quite keeping up with what the grid needs. Adding more panels or turbines would help close the gap.","I'm seeing the grid pull more power than our renewables can provide. Some additional renewable capacity would help balance things out.","The renewable setup is doing its part but the grid wants more. Expanding the renewable array would help reduce our reliance on backup power.","We've got renewables producing but demand is outpacing them. More renewable sources would help the grid run more independently."},new string[]{"I've noticed our renewables aren't putting out much at all. We might want to check if something is blocking them or if they need to be repositioned.","Our renewable sources are barely producing anything. Something might be obstructing them or they may need a better position.","The renewables are pretty much sitting idle right now. It might be worth checking their placement to make sure they can do their job.","I'm not getting much from our renewable setup. They could be blocked or angled wrong - worth taking a look."},new string[]{"Things are balanced right now but there's not much wiggle room. If demand goes up or generation dips, we'll start pulling from batteries right away.","We're running pretty tight on power. Everything is covered for now, but there's not a lot of headroom if anything changes.","Generation is just barely meeting demand. It wouldn't take much to tip us into draining batteries - a little extra capacity would go a long way.","I'm seeing our generation just keeping up with load. We're one new block away from tipping into battery drain - some extra headroom would be nice."},new string[]{"There are no batteries on the grid right now. If generation drops for any reason, there's no buffer to keep things running.","I'm not seeing any batteries out there. Without them, any dip in power generation means blocks start losing power immediately.","We're running without any battery backup. Adding even a few batteries would give us a safety cushion if something goes offline.","No batteries on the grid means no safety net. Everything depends on generation staying online - batteries would really help here."},new string[]{"All of our power is coming from fuel-burning sources right now. Any renewable generation we add would help stretch our fuel reserves.","We're running entirely on fuel. Even a small renewable setup would take some pressure off and make our fuel last longer.","Everything is powered by reactors or H2 right now. Adding some renewables would give us free power and save fuel for when we really need it.","I notice we don't have any renewable generation. Some solar panels or wind turbines would help reduce our fuel dependency."},new string[]{"Things are running fine on renewables for now, but I've noticed our uranium reserves are getting low. It would be good to stock up while we have the chance.","We don't need the reactors right now, but our uranium supply is running thin. Might be worth restocking so we're ready when we do need them.","Renewables are handling the load nicely, but we're low on uranium. If conditions change and we need backup, we'll want to have fuel ready.","Just a heads up - uranium is getting low. We're fine for now on renewables, but it's worth topping off the fuel supply when we get a chance."},new string[]{"Everything is running smoothly right now, but our hydrogen reserves are getting low. Might be a good time to stock up on ice.","We don't need the H2 engines at the moment, but the tanks are running low. Worth restocking so we're ready if things change.","Renewables are carrying the load, but I'm noticing H2 levels dropping. Topping off the tanks now would save us trouble later.","Just a heads up - hydrogen is getting thin. We're covered for now, but having a full reserve ready is always a good idea."}
